{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想系統化準備日語能力試，又不想在筆記與測驗之間東拼西湊？My Nihongo 把 JLPT 各級詞彙、筆記與測驗整合在同一個介面。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合正準備 JLPT 或日常自學日語的用家。</p>\n\n<h2>JLPT 詞彙筆記與測驗整合</h2>\n<p>My Nihongo 收錄 JLPT N5 至 N1 各級詞彙與例句，適合準備日語能力試的學習者。筆記可寫成自由文字，或整理成結構化的詞彙與句型清單，並透過免持的單字電台持續聆聽想學的詞彙。筆記亦可由剪貼板文字快速建立，再轉成個人化測驗，集中練習指定詞彙與句子；發音練習則採用 Apple 內建語音朗讀，跟隨輔助使用設定中的日語語音。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-37-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-378-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-379-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-380-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：My Nihongo</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T14:39:35.996665+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}